            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Titre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To play and pause from here, turn on View › Developer › Allow JavaScript from Apple Events in Chrome. It lets any app you allow to control Chrome run scripts in its pages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para reproducir y pausar desde aquí, activa View › Developer › Allow JavaScript from Apple Events en Chrome. Permite que cualquier app autorizada a controlar Chrome ejecute scripts en sus páginas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour la lecture et la pause d’ici, activez View › Developer › Allow JavaScript from Apple Events dans Chrome. Cela permet à toute app autorisée à contrôler Chrome d’exécuter des scripts dans ses pages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
